:: Forest - kidnapper rescue [bg-forest]
<h1 class="ptitle">FOREST</h1>
<br />

<<set _kidnapped = $guests[$forestKidnapEvent]>>
<<newguy>>
<<set $tmpGuy.name = 'Kidnapper'>>

<center>
    <<image 'places/forest/forest_kidnapper_rescue.jpg' sfw>>
</center>
<br />

The trail wasn't hard to follow — they hadn't expected anyone to come after them. You moved fast, cutting through the undergrowth, and found them maybe two miles in at an old lean-to shelter. Three men. <<=setup.displayName(_kidnapped)>> was tied to one of the posts. She saw you through the gap in the wall before they did.
<br /><br />

<<addhours 3>>

<<if $backpack.has('revolver') || $backpack.has('shotgun')>>
<div id="fkr_gun">
<<linkreplace 'Step into the clearing'>>
    <<if setup.percentageChance(70)>>
        You stepped into the clearing with the weapon already up. They took one look and ran — no argument, no hesitation. Some men know when they've lost before it starts.
        <br /><br />
        You cut <<=setup.displayName(_kidnapped)>> loose. She didn't say anything for a while. Just stood there, breathing. Then she nodded and followed you back.
        <br /><br />
        <<set _kidnapped.relationship = Math.max((_kidnapped.relationship ?? 0) + 15, -100)>>
        <<set _kidnapped.happy = Math.max((_kidnapped.happy ?? 0) - 15, -100)>>
        <<set _kidnapped.sick = {days: randomInteger(2, 5), desc: 'Shaken and bruised', id: 'exhaustion'}>>
        <<set $forestKidnapEvent = null>>
        <strong>(<<=setup.displayName(_kidnapped)>>: Relationship +15, Happy −15, sick <<=_kidnapped.sick.days>> days)</strong>
        <br /><br />
        <<link 'Take her home'>>
            <<goto 'Wood cabin'>>
        <</link>>
    <<else>>
        None of them moved. The closest one kept his eyes on the barrel, knife already in hand.
        <br /><br />
        <<sayNpc $tmpGuy>>
            You won't shoot. Not over some girl.
        <</sayNpc>>
        <br />
        He was wrong about that.
        <br /><br />
        <<link 'Fight them'>>
            <<generateEnemies 3>>
            <<fight $enemies 'Forest - kidnapper rescue won' 'Forest - kidnapper rescue lost'>>
        <</link>>
    <</if>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<<else>>
<div id="fkr_move">
<<linkreplace 'Move in'>>
    All three turned as you stepped into the clearing — knives already drawn, no hesitation. They'd done this before.
    <br /><br />
    <<link 'Fight them'>>
        <<generateEnemies 3>>
        <<fight $enemies 'Forest - kidnapper rescue won' 'Forest - kidnapper rescue lost'>>
    <</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<</if>>
